flowchart TB
  accTitle: Bank import
  accDescr: A stable statement for the expected account is copied under a lock. Actual Budget is backed up before import using stable transaction IDs. A verified receipt allows archiving. An uncertain write pauses the watcher for audit.
  csv["Read bank CSV"] --> ready{"Stable file,<br/>expected account?"}
  ready -->|No| wait["Wait or record rejection"]
  ready -->|Yes| lock["Lock and fingerprint the snapshot"]
  lock --> write["Back up budget and import<br/>using stable transaction IDs"]
  write --> audit{"Receipt and<br/>read-back verified?"}
  audit -->|Unclear| pause["Pause watcher<br/>and inspect audit"]
  audit -->|Verified| archive["Verify archive<br/>against original"]
